Z||000000||JetroGT||01-03-2000||03:42 AM||||<BR>I have an 86 SE V6 with the 120mph gauges. I was driving at about 30-35mph when I looked down at the tripometer and realized it was going in reverse! I wish that were true for the odometer.<BR>What would cause this? Bad gears?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||01-03-2000||05:08 AM||||Bad drugs might be a problem, too. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  At least that was my problem.  Then I realized I was looking at my watch and I had it on upside down.  It's amazing what the wrong prescription will do for you! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
