Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||01-03-2000||12:56 PM||||That's pretty weird. The (trip-) odometer was actually designed so it can't go backwards... ||||reg||5
Z||000004||fiero56||01-03-2000||01:01 PM||||I've never heard of the trip odometers going backwards, but back when the Fiero was being produced GM put out a service bulletin, stating there have been instances when the trip odometer doesn't work after being reset. The solution was to always push the reset button twice when resetting.||||reg||1
